ments-service/pull/101\n\nI didn't merge it, since merging into main needs a code owner's approval. Also, I couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory tool doesn't recognise it. The change follows what the code comment and the test say FIN-212 requires.", "type": "text"}]}]}